OBJECT:
Add two (2) KONE KCM83 1 Traction elevators, located at the Timothy E. Wilson
Board of Public Utilities’ Administration/Engineering Building, 2416 Snyder
Avenue, Cheyenne, Wyoming, at the cost ofFive Hundred Seventy-Two Dollars and
Sixty-Eight Cents ($572.68) per month for both elevators, effective March 1, 2019.
All other terms and conditions of the existing agreement and amendments thereto shall
remain in full force and effect.
This agreement will become effective upon execution by the parties following Governing
Body approval.
